# AI Sketch
===
 AI-Sketch is a lightweight desktop application focused on sketch creation. Combined with artificial intelligence capabilities, it helps users draw, optimize and generate line drafts efficiently. Whether it is drafting, hand-drawn line drawing or creative sketch creation, it can provide a smooth and intelligent drawing experience on the desktop. ..
